   "body": "### Capture result (partial)\nCorpus: `R74` note; PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nHFR sends `md_user=deleted` on **every logged-in page**, but only for `domain=.forum.hardware.fr` and already expired (1970), next to the real value for `.hardware.fr`. A stale session (`R70a`–`R70d`) and the tokenless `unlog.php` (`R72a`) send no cookie at all.\nStill open: the answer of a real logout (`unlog.php` with `codehex`). Changes: LOT-044, #383.",
